        "quote": "(a) On or before Tuesday of each week, every precious metal dealer shall report the description of all property received in pledge or purchased as a precious metal dealer during the preceding calendar week, in whatever quantity received. This report shall be submitted to the Chief of Police.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.125.070:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
